    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>Utilize items and skills to battle cultists in isolation. As the story unfolds, conspiracies hidden beneath the night will gradually come to light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Exploration: Control the character in third person perspective to explore maps, discover puzzles, and solve them.<br></li><li> Battle: Engage in combat with enemies in first person perspective. Properly combining skills will increase your chances of survival.<br></li><li> Planning: Discover items and skills, upgrade them, and choose the most reasonable combinations.<br></li><li> Side Quests: Non-compulsory side quests that you can completely ignore despite the screams in your ears.<br></li><li> Puzzle solving: Utilize tools in hand to solve the troubles encountered.<br></li><li> Mild Horror: Experience horror stories in a town full of eerie events.<br></li><li> Save Function: The game automatically saves progress according to chapters.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>Utilize items and skills to battle cultists in isolation. As the story unfolds, conspiracies hidden beneath the night will gradually come to light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Exploration: Control the character in third person perspective to explore maps, discover puzzles, and solve them.<br></li><li> Battle: Engage in combat with enemies in first person perspective. Properly combining skills will increase your chances of survival.<br></li><li> Planning: Discover items and skills, upgrade them, and choose the most reasonable combinations.<br></li><li> Side Quests: Non-compulsory side quests that you can completely ignore despite the screams in your ears.<br></li><li> Puzzle solving: Utilize tools in hand to solve the troubles encountered.<br></li><li> Mild Horror: Experience horror stories in a town full of eerie events.<br></li><li> Save Function: The game automatically saves progress according to chapters.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Control two victims, survive the night filled with the tolling of church bells.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean",
